<Slide style={{ padding: '32px 60px', background: '#FFFFFF' }}>
  <Box style={{
    flexDirection: 'column',
    width: '100%',
    height: '100%',
    gap: 20,
  }}>
    {/* 页眉 */}
    <Box style={{
      flexDirection: 'row',
      alignItems: 'center',
      justifyContent: 'space-between',
      height: 40,
      borderBottom: '2px solid #1E4FA8',
    }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>讨论：三大核心发现</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>Discussion</Text>
    </Box>
    {/* 三个发现 */}
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 18, flex: 1 }}>
      <Box style={{
        flexDirection: 'row',
        gap: 18,
        alignItems: 'center',
      }}>
        <Box style={{
          width: 64,
          height: 64,
          background: '#1E4FA8',
          borderRadius: '50%',
          justifyContent: 'center',
          alignItems: 'center',
        }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>1</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{
          flex: 1,
          background: '#F0F5FC',
          borderRadius: 8,
          padding: 18,
          gap: 8,
        }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>Setting-specific 目标暴露"鲁棒性悬崖"</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
            agnostic→specific 在闭标签下崩溃，开标签后仍很低。外观、视角、上下文偏移在最困难情形下压倒标签不匹配——域偏移占主导。
          </Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{
        flexDirection: 'row',
        gap: 18,
        alignItems: 'center',
      }}>
        <Box style={{
          width: 64,
          height: 64,
          background: '#1E4FA8',
          borderRadius: '50%',
          justifyContent: 'center',
          alignItems: 'center',
        }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>2</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{
          flex: 1,
          background: '#F0F5FC',
          borderRadius: 8,
          padding: 18,
          gap: 8,
        }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>跨数据集偏移是方向性的</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
            许多迁移对强烈不对称，"domain gap" 不能视为对称。只报单向精选结果会隐藏更难方向、夸大鲁棒性。
          </Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{
        flexDirection: 'row',
        gap: 18,
        alignItems: 'center',
      }}>
        <Box style={{
          width: 64,
          height: 64,
          background: '#1E4FA8',
          borderRadius: '50%',
          justifyContent: 'center',
          alignItems: 'center',
        }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>3</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{
          flex: 1,
          background: '#F0F5FC',
          borderRadius: 8,
          padding: 18,
          gap: 8,
        }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>标签不匹配真实但有界</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
            开标签一致但有限的增益 + near-miss 统计可区分语义近失与真正混淆。开标签后的大残余下降指向标签对齐之外的鲁棒性失败。
          </Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
</Slide>